{
  "_comment": "Phase 1.1 (research): ema_pool winner + Differentiable Spearman loss (torchsort-style soft rank, sigmoid pairwise). Tests if direct rank-IC optimization beats utility_rank proxy. lambda_diff_spearman=0.3 matched to utility_rank weight; temperature=1.0 (z-scored inputs in loss).",
  "data": {
    "csv_path": "",
